      },
      "message": "fix(units): status lines, refusals and the gate's gouge clause speak the document's units\n\nTier 1 of #578: transient strings - the ones that quote the numbers the user is already reading - now format through app::units::of(world) and the pure geometry::units formatters, so an inch document hears inches. New vol formatter mirrors area (inches get three extra decimals); Unit::vol_suffix gains the superscript spellings so mm sentences stay byte-identical. deviate_readout takes a Unit like its sibling sim_readout. Persisted notes (tier 2) wait for the structured-note pattern; machine-limit and pure-crate refusals stay put - docs/decisions/578-units-in-errors.md keeps the reasons.",
